name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q7_2026-pilot'

question 'A student shares their full name, birthday, school name, and a photo of their student ID with an AI tutoring tool to "personalize" their experience. What is the PRIMARY concern with this behavior?'

wrong 'The AI tutoring tool will not work properly without this information.'
wrong 'Sharing a birthday is always private, but a name and school are fine to share.'
wrong 'The concern is mostly about the photo taking up too much storage space.'
right 'Combining multiple pieces of identifying information — even ones that seem harmless individually — creates a detailed profile that could be misused or exposed in a data breach.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

